	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_gui_stalker_id_bush_pierce">
		<text>Bush pierces</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_gui_stalker_id_bush_pierce_desc">
		<text>How many bushes the look-ray and LOS ray may punch through. 0 = bushes block like walls. Walls always block.</text>
